;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; coding
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C00,Engine Control Unit (J623) Coding
C01,00?xxxx: Additional Functions
C02,0 = Service Interval Extension (SIE) active
C03,5 = Service Interval Extension (SIE) inactive
C04,00x?xxx: Options
C05,+1 = Climate Control installed
C01,00xx?xx: Powertrain
C02,0 = Front-Wheel-Drive (FWD)
C03,1 = All-Wheel-Drive (AWD)
C04,00x0x?x: CAN-Databus
C05,+1 = Anti-Lock Braking System (ABS)
C06,+2 = Airbags
C07,+4 = Climate Control (Climatronic)
C08,00x0xx?: Transmission
C14,2 = Manual Transmission
C15,5 = Automatic Transmission
;
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; login/coding-ii
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
L00,Engine Control Unit (J623) Coding-2
L01,11463 = Cruise Control System (CCS) Activation
L02,16167 = Cruise Control System (CCS) Deactivation
L03,12233 = Adaptation Enabling
L04, 
L05,Note (Immobilizer): Prior to adapting a new USED Engine Control
L06,Modile the Vehicle specific PIN/SKC (IMMO-Login) of the new USED
L07,Engine Control Module (ECM) has to be used to enable the adaptation.
L08,You'll find the PIN/SKC on the Key Tag of the additional Key
L09,(of the Donor Car) or you can acquire it through your responsible
L10,Distribution Center or Importer.
;
