;
; adaptation
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
A007,0,Speed Limit (by Law)
A007,1,Engine Speed,(G28)
A007,2,Vehicle Speed,(Limit)
A007,3,Vehicle Speed,(Current)
A007,5,Speed Limit (by Law)
A007,6,The Speed Limit required by Law can only be adjusted once and to a lower Value.
A007,7,Once set it can neither be raised or disabled. Only use this Adaptation Channel
A007,8,if you know exactly what you are doing!
A007,10,
A007,11,Range: 80...190 km/h
A007,12, 
A007,13,Note: The Customer requested Speed Limit can be found in Adaptation Channel 014
A007,14,which can be activated/set and deactivated if the Customers wants to to that.
;
A014,0,Speed Limit (by Customer)
A014,5,Speed Limit (by Customer)
A014,6,The Customer requested Speed Limit can be adjusted and removed
A014,7,as often as necessary. This voluntary Limit may be interesting to
A014,8,Fleet Owners and Delivery Companies. The Customer requested Speed
A014,9,Limit can be disabled with special PIN which is available from your
A014,10,VCDS Distributor or Ross-Tech directly.
A014,11, 
A014,12,Range: 80...190 km/h
